Dear Document Owner, 

This is a notification to inform you that a document Review process has been completed, or the 7 Days review period has expired.

Please review the document at your earliest convenience to ensure that any necessary updates or actions are completed. 

Document No.: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Document_x0020_Number']}
Document Title: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Project_x0020_Title']}
Document Owner: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Document_x0020_Owner/DisplayName']}
Reviewers: @{variables('Reviewers')}

Reviewers Responses (within the 7 days): 
@{if(empty(body('Html_to_text')),'None',body('Html_to_text'))}

Dear Document Owner,

This is a notification to inform you that a document requires a review. The document will expire in one month.

Please review the document at your earliest convenience to ensure that any necessary updates or actions are completed. 

Document No.: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Document_x0020_Number']}
Document Title: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Project_x0020_Title']}
Document Owner: @{outputs('Get_file_properties_-_Document')?['body/Document_x0020_Owner/DisplayName']}

Reviewers: There are no Reviewers listed.
